5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the ground shifting under the diggers. We need to know what the soil can actually handle.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The site is crossed daily. We must ensure the plan fits how people actually move through it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious who will mow the grass every week. The rota seems very short these days.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Drawings are pretty, but they rot. I want to see what our last decade of projects looks like now.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am quiet, but I worry about the bills. What will this cost the city to keep after the ribbon is cut?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, do you have specific examples of failed projects? I want to check the earth-moving firms too.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the firms are key. I will look at the drainage records to see if the ground fights back.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, I will check the groundskeeping roll. I need to know if there are enough people to care for it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will review the condition of the earlier works. If the apron is patched, the new one will be too.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the upkeep ledger. I need to see the real cost per hectare for different surfaces.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will also check the depot phasing notes. Can we keep the park open while we build?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the timed counts of weekday crossings. We need to respect the pedestrian flow.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will also look at the volunteer groups. Maybe they can help with the daily care?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I will also check the record of the eastern avenue planting. If trees die, the plan fails.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the terms of the regional habitat fund. I need to know what is actually funded.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
