34,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Only two firms tender for earth-moving, and they flagged clay subsoil risk. That is a major constraint.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The drainage callouts have doubled since the culvert was capped. The ground is clearly struggling with water.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The groundskeeping roll has fallen to seven posts. We are relying heavily on bought-in services now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,The apron outside the civic hall has been patched three times. Our previous hard surfaces are failing fast.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The habitat fund only pays for planting and water, not surfacing or buildings. That changes the budget significantly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if drainage is failing, does that rule out any plan that adds more hard surface?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, likely. The heat readings are also high. We need something that cools the site, not heats it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, if the fund doesn't cover buildings, does that make the sports terraces impossible?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the terraces need changing facilities. If the fund won't pay for them, we are stuck.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, the upkeep ledger shows planted ground costs triple to maintain. That is a long-term burden.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"The phasing notes say the south can be hoarded off, but the centre cannot. We must keep the centre open.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The timed counts show people stick to firm, open ground. They avoid the softer margins.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"The volunteer groups are active, but they are casual. They can't replace the lost professional staff.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,The eastern avenue trees died because aftercare was missing. We must ensure maintenance is contracted properly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If we choose a wetland plan, the fund covers it, but the upkeep cost is high. Is it worth it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
